{"slug":"w-q-y","ar":"و ق ي","total":258,"core":"protection; God-consciousness","forms":[{"ar":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","kind":"verb","form":8,"count":166,"gloss":"To fear (Allah), be mindful of Him","word":"ittaqa","ex":{"s":26,"a":108,"p":1,"ar":["فَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُونِ"],"en":"So fear Allah and obey me"}},{"ar":"مُتَّقِين","kind":"active participle","form":8,"count":49,"gloss":"God-conscious, righteous","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":90,"p":3,"ar":["وَأُزْلِفَتِ","ٱلْجَنَّةُ","لِلْمُتَّقِينَ"],"en":"And Paradise will be brought near [that Day] to the righteous"}},{"ar":"تَقْوَى","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":17,"gloss":"God-consciousness, piety","word":"at-taqwa","ex":{"s":91,"a":8,"p":3,"ar":["فَأَلْهَمَهَا","فُجُورَهَا","وَتَقْوَىٰهَا"],"en":"And inspired it [with discernment of] its wickedness and its righteousness"}},{"ar":"وَقَىٰ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":16,"gloss":"to protect, save","word":null,"ex":{"s":52,"a":27,"p":4,"ar":["فَمَنَّ","ٱللَّهُ","عَلَيْنَا","وَوَقَىٰنَا","عَذَابَ","ٱلسَّمُومِ"],"en":"So Allah conferred favor upon us and protected us from the punishment of the Scorching Fire"}},{"ar":"تَقِيّ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"God-fearing, pious","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":13,"p":6,"ar":["وَحَنَانًا","مِّن","لَّدُنَّا","وَزَكَوٰةً ۖ","وَكَانَ","تَقِيًّا"],"en":"And affection from Us and purity, and he was fearing of Allah"}},{"ar":"وَاق","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"protector, defender","word":null,"ex":{"s":13,"a":34,"p":14,"ar":["لَّهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","فِى","ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","وَلَعَذَابُ","ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","أَشَقُّ ۖ","وَمَا","لَهُم","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","مِن","وَاقٍ"],"en":"For them will be punishment in the life of [this] world, and the punishment of the Hereafter is more severe. And they will not have from Allah any protector"}},{"ar":"أَتْقَى","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"most God-fearing","word":null,"ex":{"s":92,"a":17,"p":2,"ar":["وَسَيُجَنَّبُهَا","ٱلْأَتْقَى"],"e